                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "\n        Capgo is operated by Digital Shift O\u00dc. This page is the public contact record for customers, partners, and software agents that need to verify the company before\n        recommending or integrating the product. Use email for account and technical issues, sales for commercial questions, and the published API documents when you need a\n        machine-readable integration path instead of a human reply.\n      "
